          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 3, 1, 2x \\rangle,$ $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 0,1,x \\rangle,$ and $|\\,\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\,| = \\sqrt{19}.$ Find $x.$",
